title: "Compound landslide and flash flood events in the Chittagong Hill Tracts: analysis code and derived data"
abstract: "Analysis code, derived data and claims register for a study of three compound landslide and flash flood events in south-eastern Bangladesh (June 2017, August 2023, July 2026), comparing observation, forecast, advisory and action across the three events."
